787	     4	//!
788	     5	//! A [`Role`] is the camera or the screen: the clip under `at`, and the
789	     6	//! REACH's later clips — every picture clip on the same track starting
790	     7	//! after `at` and before the earliest of the first later layout action's
791	     8	//! absolute start on that track, `through` and the track's end.
